          ],
          "correct": 3,
          "explanation": "<p>We know the formula for angular magnification is,</p>\n<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp; .</p>\n<p>from above formula we can say for increasing in M focal length (f) should be decreased or&nbsp;power of the lens should be increased.</p>\n<p>Hence option (D) is correct option.</p>"
