        {
          "id": "69452fa69537319e1ec34b18",
          "question": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The length of a microscope tube is \\( 20 \\mathrm{~cm} \\). The focal length of the objective and eye lens are \\( 0.5 \\mathrm{~cm} \\) and \\( 1 \\mathrm{~cm} \\). The magnifying power of the microscope is about: (when image is formed at infinity)</p>",
